sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client / Aplicación
    participant API as API Collections Retrieve - Composition <br> Epica 65964: ConsultaCobranzasH2H <br> HU 65982: POST /collections-retrieve/v1/retrieve <br> ms-ic-comp-collections_retrieve-composition
    participant CL as Caché Local
    participant Param as Lib Regionalizacion <br> lib-java-webflux_core-xrs v. 2.4.2-SNAPSHOT
    participant Lib as Librería Pipeline (ConfigMap)
    participant validah2h as API Counterparty Admin Product <br> HU 53666 <br> GET /market-data/counterparty-admin/v1/validate-H2H-access
    participant homologador as Liberería de <br> Homologación
    participant availReq as API Available Requests Admin - System <br> HU 65987 <br> POST /available-requests-admin/v1/retrieve
    participant agreements as API Collections Retrieve - Product <br> HU 66014 <br> POST /collateral-administration/collections-retrieves/v1/retrieve-agreement
    participant fields as API Collections Retrieve - Product <br> HU 66016 <br> GET /collections/collections-retrieve/v1/retrieve-collection-field
    participant facade as Manejador Fachada Inversa <br> HU 58729 : ms-ic-comp-facade_inverse-handler <br> HU 7756 : Contrato API Fachada Collection Retrieve
    participant availReqUpd as API Available Requests Admin - System <br> HU 66021 <br> PUT /available-requests-admin/v1/update
    participant cloudWatch as AWS Cloud Watch
    participant Errors as Lib Errores <br> lib-java-webflux_core-xrs v. 2.4.2-SNAPSHOT

    Note over Client, Errors: Flujo Honduras (HN01) - Consulta Cobranzas H2H (Composición)

    Client->>API: POST /collections-retrieve/v1/retrieve
    Note right of Client: Headers: <br> Source-Bank, Authorization, <br> Application-Id <br> Body: <br> data.customerReference, <br> data.services.serviceList[] <br> (serviceId, debtors.debtorList[])

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
    Note over API, Client: Validación Campos Obligatorios
    API->>API: Validación Esquema OpenAPI
    API->>API: Validar Headers obligatorios <br> Source-Bank, Authorization, Application-Id
    API->>API: Validar Body obligatorios <br> data.customerReference, data.services.serviceList[].serviceId, <br> data.services.serviceList[].debtors.debtorList[].debtorCode, <br> data.services.serviceList[].debtors.debtorList[].returnType, <br> data.services.serviceList[].debtors.debtorList[].extendedCollection <br> data.services.serviceList[].debtors.debtorList[].additionalInfo.infoList[].fieldName <br> data.services.serviceList[].debtors.debtorList[].additionalInfo.infoList[].fieldValue
    alt Errores de validación
        API->>Client: Error 400 Bad Request
    end
    end

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
    Note over Client, Param: Proceso Validación Regional
    API->>API: Cache Local <br> key: collections-retrieve

    alt Consulta parámetros en caché local

        API->>CL: Consultar parámetros de Lib Regionalizacion en caché local
        Note right of API: Domain: "COLLECTIONS_RETRIEVE" <br> name: "RETRIEVE" <br> country: XRS

        CL->>API: Obtiene parámetros de Lib Regionalizacion en Caché Local
        Note left of CL: Obtiene parámetros de regionalización y negocio

    else Cache MISS - Consulta Lib Regionalizacion

        API->>Param: Consultar parámetros en Lib Regionalizacion
        Note right of API: Domain: "COLLECTIONS_RETRIEVE" <br> name: "RETRIEVE" <br> country: XRS

        Param->>API: Obtiene parámetros Lib Regionalizacion
        Note left of Param: Obtiene parámetros de regionalización y negocio

        API->>CL: Guarda parámetros en caché local (TTL 24h)

    end

    API->>API: Validar Servicio Regional
    Note over API: Regiones Disponibles de Dynamo: <br> HN01-HN01

    alt Región no encontrada o enabled: false
        API->>Client: Error 422 (REGION_NOT_CONFIGURED / REGION_NOT_ENABLED)
    end
    end

    Note over API: Uso del Patrón Strategy
    API->>API: Selecciona Estrategia por Source-Bank

    alt Source-Bank = HN01

        API->>Lib: Consulta Constantes

        Lib->>API: Retorna constantes necesarias
        Note left of Lib: Constantes: <br> caller-service

        API->>homologador: Consulta Homologación Caller-Service a idProxy
        Note right of API: domain: CALLER_SERVICE <br> name: CATALOGATE <br> value.name = const.caller-service

        homologador->>API: Retorna Valor Homologado 
        Note left of homologador: response.value.idProxy <br> COLLECTIONS_RETRIEVE-COMPOSITION-RETRIEVE → "FICBCO0258"

        Note over API, validah2h: Paso 1: Validar acceso a operaciones hos-to-host

        API->>API: Preparar Payload - Valida acceso H2H
        Note over API: Mapeo: <br> userReference = header.Application-Id, <br> operationType = libparam.operation, <br> proxyIdentifier = responseHomologador.value.idProxy, <br> countryCode = header.Source-Bank, <br> customerReference = request.data.customerReference

        API->>validah2h: Consume API - Valida acceso H2H
        Note right of API: userReference, operationType, proxyIdentifier, countryCode, customerReference

        validah2h->>API: Response Valida acceso H2H
        Note left of validah2h: authorizationReference, messageCode, messageDescription

        API->>API: Evaluar Response - Valida acceso H2H

        alt If Response Valida acceso H2H HTTP Code != 200

            API->> Client: Retorna error generado por API Valida acceso H2H
            Note left of API: HTTP 4XX / 5XX

        else Response Valida acceso H2H HTTP Code = 200

            Note over API, Lib: Paso 2: Validar número de solicitudes

            API->>API: Cuenta cantidad de serviceIds en request
            Note over API: $maxRequestsIn = count(serviceList[].debtors.debtorList[])

            API->>API: Valida parámetro maxRequestAllowed
            Note over API: If libparam.maxRequestAllowed no exists then <br> maxRequestAllowed = 10 (Valor default)
            
            API->>API: Valida Cantidad de serviceIds en request

            alt If $maxRequestsIn > libpram.maxRequestAllowed

                API->> Errors: Mapear código de error

                Errors ->> API: Retorna código mapeado

                API->> Client: Retorna error
                Note left of API: HTTP 422 — Cantidad de servicios en solicitud excede límite permitido

            else 

                Note over API, availReq: Paso 3: Validar peticiones disponibles por día

                API->>API: Preparar Payload - AvailableRequestsAdmin/retrieve
                Note over API: data.userCode = header.Application-User <br> data.serviceId = responseHomologador.value.idProxy <br> data.operationType = libparam.operation <br> data.requestCount = $maxRequestsIn

                API->>availReq: CALL POST /available-requests-admin/v1/retrieve
                Note right of API: userCode, serviceId, operationType, requestCount

                availReq->>API: Response AvailableRequestsAdmin/retrieve
                Note left of availReq: allowedRequestCount, successfulCount, <br> errorCount, dateTime

                API->>API: Evaluar Response - AvailableRequestsAdmin/retrieve

                alt If Response AvailableRequestsAdmin/retrieve HTTP Code != 200

                    API->> Client: Retorna error generado por API AvailableRequestsAdmin/retrieve
                    Note left of API: HTTP 4XX / 5XX

                else Response AvailableRequestsAdmin/retrieve HTTP Code = 200

                    Note over API, agreements: Paso 4: Consultar convenios registrados por servicio y país

                    API->>API: Preparar Payload - CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-agreement
                    Note over API: data.serviceIdList = serviceList[].serviceId (array)

                    API->>agreements: CALL - POST /collateral-administration/collections-retrieves/v1/retrieve-agreement
                    Note right of API: header: <br> sourceBank = header.sourceBank <br> body: <br> serviceIdList = serviceList[].serviceId (array)

                    agreements->>API: Response CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-agreement
                    Note left of agreements: agreementList[] <br> (serviceId, contractId, description)

                    API->>API: Evaluar Response - CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-agreement

                    alt If Response CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-agreement HTTP Code != 200

                        API->> Client: Retorna error generado por API CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-agreement
                        Note left of API: HTTP 4XX / 5XX

                    else Response CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-agreement HTTP Code = 200

                        API->>API: Inicializa variables
                        Note over API: $errorAmount = 0 <br> $successAmount = 0

                        Note over API, fields: Paso 5: FOR EACH serviceId - CICLO 1 POR CADA SERVICE ID Consultar campos de cobranza por servicio (por cada serviceId)  <br> Uso de Liibrería sugerida : Completable Future de Java para manejo asincrónico de respuestas de cada serviceId y optimización del tiempo total de respuesta del API Collections Retrieve

                        rect rgb(237, 246, 232)
                        
                            API->>API: Valida Response Convenios por serviceId
                            Note over API: $contractId = count(agreements.response.agreementList[N].contractId)

                            alt If $contractId == 0

                                API->>API: Construye Response para data.services.serviceList[N]
                                Note over API: response.services.serviceList[N].successIndicator = "NO RECORDS" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].errorMessage = "Ningún contrato asociado al servicio devolvió información". <br> response.services.serviceList[N].serviceId = data.services.serviceList[N].serviceId 
                                
                                API->>API: Aumenta $errorAmount para cada deudor que pertenece al serviceId (data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M])
                                Note over API: $errorAmount = $errorAmount + 1

                                API->>API: Pasa al siguiente serviceId (continúa FOR EACH)

                            else $contractId > 0

                                API->>API: Preparar Payload - CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-collection-field
                                Note over API: serviceId = serviceList[N].serviceId <br> operationType = libparam.operationFields

                                API->>fields: CALL - GET /collections/collections-retrieve/v1/retrieve-collection-field
                                Note right of API: serviceId, operationType

                                fields->>API: Response CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-collection-field
                                Note left of fields: collectionFieldList[] <br> (originField, destinationPosition)

                                API->>API: Evaluar Response - CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-collection-field

                                alt If Response CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-collection-field HTTP Code != 200

                                    API->>API: Construye Response para data.services.serviceList[N]
                                    Note over API: response.services.serviceList[N].successIndicator = "ERROR" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].errorMessage = "Se producoto un error en la ejecución del API Collections Retrieve". <br> response.services.serviceList[N].serviceId = data.services.serviceList[N].serviceId

                                    API->>API: Aumenta $errorAmount para cada deudor que pertenece al serviceId (data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M])
                                    Note over API: $errorAmount = $errorAmount + 1

                                    API->>API: Pasa al siguiente serviceId (continúa FOR EACH)

                                else Response CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-collection-field HTTP Code = 200

                                    API->>API: Comienza a construir Response API - Campos serviceList[]
                                    Note over API: response.services.serviceList[N].successIndicator = "SUCCESS" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].serviceId = data.services.serviceList[N].serviceId <br> response.services.serviceList[N].serviceName = agreements.response.agreementList[N].description <br> debtors {}

                                    API->>API: Cuenta cantidad de debtors por serviceId
                                    Note over API: $numDebtors = count(serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[])

                                    Note over API, facade: Paso 6: CICLO 2 POR CADA DEUDOR - FOR EACH debtorList hasta $numDebtors - Ejecutar consulta masiva de cobranzas (Split por deudor) <br> Uso de Liibrería sugerida : Completable Future de Java para manejo asincrónico de respuestas de cada deudor y optimización del tiempo total de respuesta del API Collections Retrieve

                                    rect rgb(234, 232, 246)

                                        API->>API: Evaluar Response - CollectionsRetrieve/retrieve-collection-field
                                        Note over API: Evaluda si existen campos para homologar en la "Fachada Inversa" para agregar el array additionalInformation[] 

                                        alt If count(collectionFieldList[]) == 0

                                            API->>API: Construye request body para "Fachada Inversa" - Campo Currency Code
                                            Note over API: If debtorList[M].currencyCode != " " then currencyCode = debtorList[M].currencyCode <br<> else <br> currencyCode = libparam.localCurrency

                                            API->>API: Construye request body para "Fachada Inversa" - Demás campos sin aditionalInformation{}
                                            Note over API: collectionReference = agreementList[N].contractId <br> payerReference = debtorList[M].debtorCode <br> invoiceReturnType = debtorList[M].returnType <br> isExtendedCollection = debtorList[M].extendedCollection

                                        else 

                                            API->>API: Construye request body para "Fachada Inversa" - Campo Currency Code
                                            Note over API: If debtorList[M].currencyCode != " " then currencyCode = debtorList[M].currencyCode <br<> else <br> currencyCode = libparam.localCurrency

                                            API->>API: Construye request body para "Fachada Inversa" - additionalInformation[]
                                            Note over API: Paso 1: $maxPosition = maxNumber(collectionFieldList[].destinationPosition) <br> Paso 2: Define additionalInformation[$maxPosition] <br> Paso 3a: Assign additionalInformation[collectionFieldList[Z].destinationPosition].supplementaryDataEntry = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].additionalInfo.infoList[K].fieldValue <br> where data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].additionalInfo.infoList[K].fieldName = collectionFieldList[Z].originField <br> Paso 3b: If collectionFieldList[Z].originField = "" then additionalInformation[collectionFieldList[Z].destinationPosition].supplementaryDataEntry = "" <br> paso 3c: If data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].additionalInfo.infoList[K].fieldValue == "" then additionalInformation[collectionFieldList[Z].destinationPosition].supplementaryDataEntry = "ERROR"
                                            Note over API: Para mayor detalle, ver sección 4.1.5. Transformaciones y Mapeos

                                            API->>API: Construye request body para "Fachada Inversa" - Demás campos
                                            Note over API: collectionReference = agreementList[N].contractId <br> payerReference = debtorList[M].debtorCode <br> invoiceReturnType = debtorList[M].returnType <br> isExtendedCollection = debtorList[M].extendedCollection
                                            
                                        end

                                        API->>API: Evalúa asignación del campo collectionReference

                                        alt If collectionReference <= 0 

                                            API->>API: Continua Construcción Response API - Campos debtorList[]
                                            Note over API: response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].successIndicator = "ERROR" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].errorMessage = "Hay campos de entrada que han sido ingresados" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].trace = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].trace <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].debtorCode = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].debtorCode <br> $errorAmount = $errorAmount + 1

                                            API->>API: Pasa al siguiente debtor (continúa FOR EACH)

                                        else If collectionReference > 0

                                            API->>facade: Invoca Fachada Inversa (consulta cobranza por deudor)
                                            Note right of API: collectionReference, payerReference, currencyCode, invoiceReturnType, isExtendedCollection, additionalInformation

                                            API->>API: Evalúa response Fachada Inversa (consulta cobranza por deudor) 

                                            alt If Response Fachada Inversa HTTP Code != 200

                                                API->>API: Continua Construcción Response API - Campos debtorList[]
                                                Note over API: response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].successIndicator = "ERROR" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].errorMessage = "Falló la invocación de la API Fachada Collection Retrieve"  <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].trace = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].trace <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].debtorCode = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].debtorCode <br> $errorAmount = $errorAmount + 1

                                                API->>API: Pasa al siguiente debtor (continúa FOR EACH)

                                            else Response Fachada Inversa HTTP Code = 200

                                                API->>API: Continua Construcción Response API - Campos debtorList[] con datos de cobranza obtenidos de Fachada Inversa
                                                Note over API: response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].successIndicator = "SUCCESS" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].errorMessage = "" <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].trace = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].trace <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].debtorCode = data.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].debtorCode <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].customerName = facade.response.collectionDetail.debtorName <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].transactionReference = facade.response.collectionDetail.billDetail <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].billId = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.invoiceReference <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].issueDate = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.invoiceIssueDate(Format ISO8601) <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].dueDate = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.invoiceDueDate(Format ISO8601) <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].dueDate = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.invoiceDueDate(Format ISO8601) <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].balances.balanceList[Q].currencyCode = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.invoiceCurrency <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].balances.balanceList[Q].amount = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.invoiceAmount <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].balances.balanceList[Q].lateFee = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.latePaymentFeeAmount <br> response.services.serviceList[N].debtors.debtorList[M].bills.billList[P].balances.balanceList[Q].lateFee = facade.response.invoiceList.invoiceRecord.totalInvoiceAmount <br> $successAmount = $successAmount + 1

                                                API->>API: Pasa al siguiente debtor (continúa FOR EACH)

                                            end

                                        end
                                    end 
                                
                                end

                            end 

                        end

                        Note over API, availReqUpd: Paso 7: Actualizar peticiones disponibles (exitosas/erróneas)

                        API->>API: Preparar Payload - /available-requests-admin/v1/update
                        Note over API: data.userCode = header.Application-User <br> data.serviceId = responseHomologador.value.idProxy <br> data.operationType = libparam.operation <br> data.successfulCount = $successAmount <br> data.errorCount = $errorAmount

                        API->>availReqUpd: CALL POST /available-requests-admin/v1/update
                        Note right of API: userCode, serviceId, operationType, successfulCount, errorCount

                        availReqUpd->>API: Response /available-requests-admin/v1/update
                        Note left of availReqUpd: HTTP CODE

                        API->>API: Evaluar Response - /available-requests-admin/v1/update

                        alt If Response /available-requests-admin/v1/update HTTP Code != 200

                            API->> cloudWatch: Genera log en Cloud Watch indicando fallo en actualización de peticiones disponibles
                            Note left of API: concat("Fallo actualización peticiones disponibles para el usuario :", header.Application-User)

                        else Response /available-requests-admin/v1/update HTTP Code = 200

                            API->>Client: 200 OK — Response HN01
                            Note right of Client: data.services.serviceList[] { <br> successIndicator, serviceId, serviceName, <br> debtors.debtorList[].debtorCode, <br> debtors.debtorList[].bills[], ... }
                        
                        end

                    end

                end 

            end
        
        end

    end 

    Note over Client, Errors: Flujo Alternativo - Error
    activate API
    alt Exception occurs
        note over Errors: Error Library Handler
        activate Errors
            API->>Errors: BusinessCoreException(apiMethod, applicationBackend, errorMessage, errorCode)
            Errors->>API: Retorna httpCode, businessErrorCode, shortDesc, longDesc
        deactivate Errors
        activate Client
            API->>Client: Retorna error
        deactivate Client
        Note over Client,Errors: Diagrama guía de manejo de errores <br> http://bit.ly/4rpKVIU
    end
    deactivate API
